<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>FCIP Prompt Library — AFC Investigations Platform</title>
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Syne:wght@400;700;800&family=DM+Mono:ital,wght@0,400;0,500;1,400&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<style>
  :root {
    --bg:       #020c18;
    --bg2:      #040e1c;
    --bg3:      #060f1e;
    --border:   #0d2340;
    --border2:  #1a3a5c;
    --accent:   #4a9eff;
    --accent2:  #1a5a9c;
    --text:     #e8f4ff;
    --text2:    #cce4ff;
    --text3:    #7aa8cc;
    --text4:    #3a6a8a;
    --text5:    #1a4a7a;
    --mono:     'DM Mono', monospace;
    --display:  'Syne', sans-serif;
    --radius:   8px;
  }
  *, *::before, *::after { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }

  html { scroll-behavior: smooth; }

  body {
    background: var(--bg);
    color: var(--text);
    font-family: var(--mono);
    font-size: 13px;
    line-height: 1.6;
    min-height: 100vh;
  }

  ::-webkit-scrollbar { width: 5px; height: 5px; }
  ::-webkit-scrollbar-track { background: var(--bg); }
  ::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb { background: var(--border2); border-radius: 3px; }

  /* ── HEADER ─────────────────────────────────── */
  header {
    position: sticky;
    top: 0;
    z-index: 200;
    background: rgba(3,15,32,0.96);
    backdrop-filter: blur(12px);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
    padding: 20px 32px 18px;
  }
  .header-inner {
    max-width: 1280px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: flex-end;
    gap: 20px;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
  }
  .header-eyebrow {
    font-size: 9px;
    letter-spacing: 4px;
    color: var(--accent2);
    margin-bottom: 6px;
  }
  .header-title {
    font-family: var(--display);
    font-weight: 800;
    font-size: clamp(20px, 3.5vw, 30px);
    letter-spacing: -0.5px;
    line-height: 1.1;
  }
  .header-sub {
    font-size: 11px;
    color: var(--text4);
    margin-top: 4px;
  }
  .header-meta {
    text-align: right;
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }
  .header-count-label { font-size: 10px; color: var(--text5); margin-bottom: 2px; }
  .header-count {
    font-family: var(--display);
    font-size: 38px;
    font-weight: 800;
    color: var(--accent);
    line-height: 1;
  }

  /* search */
  .search-wrap {
    position: relative;
    margin-top: 16px;
    max-width: 380px;
  }
  .search-icon {
    position: absolute;
    left: 11px;
    top: 50%;
    transform: translateY(-50%);
    color: var(--text5);
    font-size: 15px;
    pointer-events: none;
    line-height: 1;
  }
  .search-input {
    width: 100%;
    background: var(--bg2);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: 7px;
    padding: 9px 12px 9px 33px;
    color: var(--text2);
    font-size: 12px;
    font-family: var(--mono);
    outline: none;
    transition: border-color 0.2s;
  }
  .search-input:focus { border-color: var(--accent2); }
  .search-input::placeholder { color: var(--text5); }

  /* ── LAYOUT ──────────────────────────────────── */
  .layout {
    max-width: 1280px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 24px 32px 60px;
    display: flex;
    gap: 28px;
    align-items: flex-start;
  }

  /* ── SIDEBAR ──────────────────────────────────── */
  .sidebar {
    width: 196px;
    flex-shrink: 0;
    position: sticky;
    top: 110px;
  }
  .sidebar-section-label {
    font-size: 9px;
    letter-spacing: 3px;
    color: var(--text5);
    margin-bottom: 10px;
  }
  .cat-btn {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: center;
    width: 100%;
    background: none;
    border: 1px solid transparent;
    border-radius: 6px;
    padding: 7px 9px;
    color: var(--text4);
    font-size: 11.5px;
    font-family: var(--mono);
    cursor: pointer;
    text-align: left;
    margin-bottom: 2px;
    transition: all 0.15s;
  }
  .cat-btn:hover { color: var(--text3); background: var(--bg2); border-color: var(--border); }
  .cat-btn.active {
    background: #071828;
    border-color: var(--border2);
    color: #7ac0ff;
  }
  .cat-count {
    background: var(--bg2);
    border-radius: 3px;
    padding: 1px 6px;
    font-size: 10px;
    color: var(--text5);
  }
  .cat-btn.active .cat-count { background: #0d2f50; color: var(--accent); }

  .how-box {
    margin-top: 28px;
    padding: 14px;
    background: var(--bg2);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: 8px;
  }
  .how-box-label {
    font-size: 9px;
    letter-spacing: 2px;
    color: var(--text5);
    margin-bottom: 10px;
  }
  .how-step {
    display: flex;
    gap: 7px;
    margin-bottom: 6px;
    color: var(--text4);
    font-size: 11px;
    line-height: 1.4;
  }
  .how-step-num { color: var(--accent2); flex-shrink: 0; }

  /* ── GRID ──────────────────────────────────────── */
  .grid-area { flex: 1; min-width: 0; }
  .grid-status {
    font-size: 11px;
    color: var(--text4);
    margin-bottom: 14px;
    min-height: 16px;
  }
  .grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill, minmax(272px, 1fr));
    gap: 13px;
  }
  .empty-state {
    padding: 70px 0;
    text-align: center;
    color: var(--text5);
  }
  .empty-icon { font-size: 30px; margin-bottom: 10px; }
  .empty-title { font-family: var(--display); font-size: 16px; color: var(--text4); margin-bottom: 4px; }

  /* ── CARD ──────────────────────────────────────── */
  .card {
    background: linear-gradient(140deg, var(--bg3) 0%, #030810 100%);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: 10px;
    padding: 17px;
    cursor: pointer;
    transition: border-color 0.2s, transform 0.2s, box-shadow 0.2s;
    position: relative;
    overflow: hidden;
    user-select: none;
  }
  .card::before {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    top: 0; right: 0;
    width: 70px; height: 70px;
    background: radial-gradient(circle at top right, rgba(0,90,200,0.10), transparent);
    pointer-events: none;
  }
  .card:hover {
    border-color: #1a5a9c;
    transform: translateY(-2px);
    box-shadow: 0 8px 28px rgba(0,80,180,0.14);
  }
  .card-top {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: flex-start;
    margin-bottom: 10px;
  }
  .card-cat-badge {
    background: #071828;
    border: 1px solid var(--border2);
    border-radius: 4px;
    padding: 3px 8px;
    font-size: 9.5px;
    color: var(--accent);
    letter-spacing: 0.3px;
  }
  .card-arrow { color: var(--text5); font-size: 15px; }
  .card-title {
    font-family: var(--display);
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: 13.5px;
    color: var(--text2);
    line-height: 1.3;
    margin-bottom: 7px;
  }
  .card-desc {
    font-size: 11.5px;
    color: var(--text4);
    line-height: 1.55;
    margin-bottom: 12px;
  }
  .card-footer { display: flex; gap: 5px; flex-wrap: wrap; }
  .pill {
    background: var(--bg2);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: 3px;
    color: #2a6a8a;
    padding: 2px 7px;
    font-size: 9.5px;
  }
  .pill-var { color: var(--accent2); }

  /* ── MODAL OVERLAY ─────────────────────────────── */
  .overlay {
    display: none;
    position: fixed;
    inset: 0;
    background: rgba(0,8,20,0.87);
    backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
    z-index: 500;
    justify-content: center;
    align-items: center;
    padding: 16px;
    animation: fadeIn 0.15s ease;
  }
  .overlay.open { display: flex; }
  @keyframes fadeIn { from { opacity: 0; } to { opacity: 1; } }

  .modal {
    background: #050f1e;
    border: 1px solid var(--border2);
    border-radius: 12px;
    width: 100%;
    max-width: 860px;
    max-height: 92vh;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    box-shadow: 0 0 70px rgba(0,100,255,0.14), 0 20px 60px rgba(0,0,0,0.6);
    animation: slideUp 0.18s ease;
  }
  @keyframes slideUp { from { transform: translateY(16px); opacity: 0; } to { transform: translateY(0); opacity: 1; } }

  .modal-header {
    padding: 20px 24px 16px;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
    flex-shrink: 0;
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: flex-start;
    gap: 16px;
  }
  .modal-eyebrow {
    font-size: 10px;
    letter-spacing: 2px;
    color: var(--accent);
    margin-bottom: 6px;
  }
  .modal-title {
    font-family: var(--display);
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: 18px;
    color: var(--text);
    line-height: 1.2;
    margin-bottom: 5px;
  }
  .modal-desc { font-size: 12px; color: var(--text4); }
  .modal-close {
    background: none;
    border: none;
    color: var(--text4);
    font-size: 18px;
    cursor: pointer;
    padding: 2px 0 2px 12px;
    flex-shrink: 0;
    transition: color 0.15s;
  }
  .modal-close:hover { color: var(--text); }

  .modal-body {
    flex: 1;
    overflow-y: auto;
    padding: 20px 24px;
  }

  /* variables */
  .vars-label {
    font-size: 10px;
    letter-spacing: 2px;
    color: var(--accent);
    margin-bottom: 12px;
  }
  .vars-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill, minmax(230px, 1fr));
    gap: 10px;
    margin-bottom: 22px;
  }
  .var-field label {
    display: block;
    font-size: 10px;
    color: var(--text3);
    margin-bottom: 4px;
    letter-spacing: 0.5px;
  }
  .var-field input {
    width: 100%;
    background: #0a1e35;
    border: 1px solid var(--border2);
    border-radius: 6px;
    padding: 8px 10px;
    color: var(--text);
    font-size: 12px;
    font-family: var(--mono);
    outline: none;
    transition: border-color 0.2s;
  }
  .var-field input:focus { border-color: var(--accent); }
  .var-field input::placeholder { color: #1a3a5c; }

  /* prompt text */
  .prompt-label {
    font-size: 10px;
    letter-spacing: 2px;
    color: var(--accent);
    margin-bottom: 10px;
  }
  .prompt-box {
    background: var(--bg);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: 8px;
    padding: 16px;
    font-family: var(--mono);
    font-size: 12px;
    color: #b8d4ee;
    line-height: 1.75;
    white-space: pre-wrap;
    word-break: break-word;
  }
  .highlight { color: #ffcc44; font-style: italic; }

  /* modal footer */
  .modal-footer {
    padding: 13px 24px;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
    display: flex;
    gap: 9px;
    align-items: center;
    flex-shrink: 0;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
  }
  .btn-copy {
    background: #003366;
    border: 1px solid #1a5a9c;
    border-radius: 6px;
    color: #7ac0ff;
    padding: 9px 18px;
    font-size: 12px;
    font-family: var(--mono);
    cursor: pointer;
    transition: all 0.2s;
    letter-spacing: 0.5px;
  }
  .btn-copy:hover { background: #004080; }
  .btn-copy.copied { background: #0a3a1a; border-color: #00aa44; color: #00cc66; }
  .btn-close-foot {
    background: none;
    border: 1px solid var(--border2);
    border-radius: 6px;
    color: var(--text4);
    padding: 9px 18px;
    font-size: 12px;
    font-family: var(--mono);
    cursor: pointer;
    transition: all 0.15s;
  }
  .btn-close-foot:hover { color: var(--text3); border-color: var(--text4); }
  .footer-tags {
    margin-left: auto;
    display: flex;
    gap: 5px;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    align-items: center;
  }

  /* ── RESPONSIVE ───────────────────────────────── */
  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    header, .layout { padding-left: 16px; padding-right: 16px; }
    .sidebar { display: none; }
    .layout { gap: 0; }
    .grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    .modal { max-height: 96vh; }
    .vars-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    .footer-tags { display: none; }
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>

<!-- ═══════════════════════════════════════════════ HEADER -->
<header>
  <div class="header-inner">
    <div>
      <div class="header-eyebrow">ANTI-FINANCIAL CRIME · INVESTIGATIONS PLATFORM</div>
      <h1 class="header-title">FCIP Prompt Library</h1>
      <p class="header-sub">Product Owner &amp; BA Automation Toolkit · React · Spring Boot · PostgreSQL · Kubernetes</p>
      <div class="search-wrap">
        <span class="search-icon">⌕</span>
        <input type="text" class="search-input" id="searchInput" placeholder="Search prompts, tags, workflows…" autocomplete="off">
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="header-meta">
      <div class="header-count-label">TOTAL PROMPTS</div>
      <div class="header-count" id="totalCount">16</div>
    </div>
  </div>
</header>

<!-- ═══════════════════════════════════════════════ LAYOUT -->
<div class="layout">

  <!-- SIDEBAR -->
  <nav class="sidebar" id="sidebar">
    <div class="sidebar-section-label">CATEGORIES</div>
    <!-- injected by JS -->

    <div class="how-box">
      <div class="how-box-label">HOW TO USE</div>
      <div class="how-step"><span class="how-step-num">1.</span>Click any card to open</div>
      <div class="how-step"><span class="how-step-num">2.</span>Fill in the variables</div>
      <div class="how-step"><span class="how-step-num">3.</span>Copy the filled prompt</div>
      <div class="how-step"><span class="how-step-num">4.</span>Paste into Claude or any LLM</div>
    </div>
  </nav>

  <!-- MAIN GRID -->
  <main class="grid-area">
    <div class="grid-status" id="gridStatus"></div>
    <div class="grid" id="grid"></div>
    <div class="empty-state" id="emptyState" style="display:none">
      <div class="empty-icon">◎</div>
      <div class="empty-title">No prompts found</div>
      <div>Try a different search term or category</div>
    </div>
  </main>

</div>

<!-- ═══════════════════════════════════════════════ MODAL -->
<div class="overlay" id="overlay">
  <div class="modal" id="modal" role="dialog" aria-modal="true">
    <div class="modal-header">
      <div>
        <div class="modal-eyebrow" id="modalEyebrow"></div>
        <div class="modal-title" id="modalTitle"></div>
        <div class="modal-desc" id="modalDesc"></div>
      </div>
      <button class="modal-close" id="modalClose" aria-label="Close">✕</button>
    </div>
    <div class="modal-body">
      <div id="varsSection">
        <div class="vars-label">FILL IN VARIABLES</div>
        <div class="vars-grid" id="varsGrid"></div>
      </div>
      <div class="prompt-label">PROMPT</div>
      <div class="prompt-box" id="promptBox"></div>
    </div>
    <div class="modal-footer">
      <button class="btn-copy" id="btnCopy">COPY PROMPT</button>
      <button class="btn-close-foot" id="btnCloseFooter">CLOSE</button>
      <div class="footer-tags" id="footerTags"></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<!-- ═══════════════════════════════════════════════ DATA + LOGIC -->
<script>
const CATEGORIES = [
  { id: "all",                label: "All Prompts",            icon: "◈" },
  { id: "user-stories",       label: "User Stories",           icon: "📋" },
  { id: "acceptance-criteria",label: "Acceptance Criteria",    icon: "✅" },
  { id: "backlog-refinement", label: "Backlog Refinement",     icon: "🔍" },
  { id: "sprint-artefacts",   label: "Sprint Artefacts",       icon: "🏃" },
  { id: "stakeholder-comms",  label: "Stakeholder Comms",      icon: "📣" },
  { id: "technical-bridge",   label: "Tech ↔ Business Bridge", icon: "🔗" },
  { id: "investigation-design",label:"Investigation Design",   icon: "🕵️" },
  { id: "regulatory",         label: "Regulatory Alignment",   icon: "⚖️" },
];

const PROMPTS = [
  // ── USER STORIES ──────────────────────────────────────────────
  {
    id:"us-1", category:"user-stories",
    title:"Generate User Story from Detection Event",
    description:"Converts a raw detection signal description into an INVEST-compliant user story for the investigator workflow.",
    tags:["FCIP","investigator","detection"],
    variables:["DETECTION_TYPE","INVESTIGATOR_PERSONA","BUSINESS_OUTCOME"],
    prompt:`You are a senior product owner on an Anti-Financial Crime Investigations Platform (FCIP) at a tier-1 multinational bank. The platform consumes structured DetectionEvents from upstream systems (transaction monitoring, sanctions screening, negative news) and provides investigators with a case management and workflow layer.

Tech stack: React front-end, Spring Boot microservices, PostgreSQL, Kubernetes.

Write a production-quality user story using the standard format:
"As a [INVESTIGATOR_PERSONA], I want to [action], so that [BUSINESS_OUTCOME]."

Detection type: [DETECTION_TYPE]

Requirements:
- Follow INVEST principles (Independent, Negotiable, Valuable, Estimable, Small, Testable)
- Include a one-sentence "Context" block explaining the compliance driver (POCA 2002, MLRs 2017, FATF, JMLSG as appropriate)
- Add a "Definition of Ready" checklist (5 items max)
- Add a "Definition of Done" checklist (5 items max)
- Flag any dependency on upstream DetectionEvent schema fields
- Keep the story to a single sprint (≤ 5 story points assumed)
- Output in clean markdown`
  },
  {
    id:"us-2", category:"user-stories",
    title:"Decompose Epic into Sprint-Sized Stories",
    description:"Breaks a large AFC epic into a prioritised, dependency-ordered set of user stories ready for sprint planning.",
    tags:["epic","decomposition","sprint planning"],
    variables:["EPIC_TITLE","EPIC_DESCRIPTION","NUMBER_OF_SPRINTS"],
    prompt:`You are a senior product owner on an Anti-Financial Crime Investigations Platform (FCIP).

Epic title: [EPIC_TITLE]
Epic description: [EPIC_DESCRIPTION]
Target delivery: [NUMBER_OF_SPRINTS] sprints

Decompose this epic into sprint-ready user stories. For each story:
1. Write the story in "As a / I want / So that" format
2. Assign a suggested story point estimate (Fibonacci: 1, 2, 3, 5, 8)
3. Identify the primary persona (AML Investigator, MLRO, Compliance Analyst, System/API)
4. Note any hard technical dependency (React component, Spring Boot endpoint, PostgreSQL schema change, K8s config)
5. Flag regulatory relevance if applicable (FATF R.20, NCA SAR, FCA SYSC)
6. Suggest a sprint sequence with a brief rationale

Output as a prioritised markdown table followed by a dependency diagram in Mermaid syntax.`
  },
  {
    id:"us-3", category:"user-stories",
    title:"Persona-Driven Story from Investigation Pain Point",
    description:"Takes a field observation or pain point and generates a user story with empathy map context.",
    tags:["persona","pain point","discovery"],
    variables:["PAIN_POINT","OBSERVED_WORKAROUND","INVESTIGATION_TYPE"],
    prompt:`You are a product owner conducting discovery on an Anti-Financial Crime Investigations Platform.

Observed pain point: [PAIN_POINT]
Current workaround investigators are using: [OBSERVED_WORKAROUND]
Investigation type: [INVESTIGATION_TYPE] (e.g., SAR, sanctions hit, PEP review, transaction pattern)

Generate:
1. A concise empathy map (Think & Feel, Hear, See, Say & Do, Pains, Gains) for the investigator persona
2. A user story that directly addresses the pain point
3. A hypothesis statement: "We believe that [building X] for [persona] will achieve [outcome]. We will know this is true when [measurable signal]."
4. Two alternative story framings — one optimised for MVP speed, one for long-term platform value
5. A risk note: what compliance or audit risk exists if this pain point is NOT resolved?

Output in markdown.`
  },

  // ── ACCEPTANCE CRITERIA ───────────────────────────────────────
  {
    id:"ac-1", category:"acceptance-criteria",
    title:"BDD Acceptance Criteria for Investigation Workflow",
    description:"Generates Given/When/Then scenarios covering happy path, edge cases, and regulatory obligations.",
    tags:["BDD","Gherkin","testing"],
    variables:["USER_STORY","REGULATION","EDGE_CASES"],
    prompt:`You are a senior BA on an Anti-Financial Crime Investigations Platform (React / Spring Boot / PostgreSQL / Kubernetes).

User story: [USER_STORY]
Primary regulatory obligation: [REGULATION]
Known edge cases to cover: [EDGE_CASES]

Write comprehensive BDD acceptance criteria in Gherkin syntax:
- Minimum 1 happy-path scenario
- Minimum 2 edge-case or error scenarios
- Minimum 1 regulatory/audit scenario (e.g., SAR submission deadline, case lock after 7 days, audit trail write)
- Each scenario must be implementable as a Spring Boot integration test and a React component test (Playwright or Cypress)
- Flag any scenario that requires a schema migration or K8s config change
- Add a "Non-Functional Acceptance Criteria" section covering: response time SLA, audit log completeness, RBAC enforcement

Output in clean Gherkin markdown with annotations.`
  },
  {
    id:"ac-2", category:"acceptance-criteria",
    title:"API Contract Acceptance Criteria",
    description:"Produces acceptance criteria for a new or modified FCIP REST endpoint, covering functional, security, and performance dimensions.",
    tags:["API","REST","Spring Boot","contract"],
    variables:["ENDPOINT_DESCRIPTION","CONSUMER_SYSTEM","DATA_SENSITIVITY"],
    prompt:`You are a BA defining acceptance criteria for a new REST API endpoint on the FCIP platform (Spring Boot microservice, PostgreSQL, deployed on Kubernetes).

Endpoint: [ENDPOINT_DESCRIPTION]
Consumer: [CONSUMER_SYSTEM] (e.g., React UI, upstream TMS, downstream SAR reporting tool)
Data sensitivity: [DATA_SENSITIVITY] (e.g., PII, SAR data, transaction records)

Generate acceptance criteria covering:
1. Functional: correct HTTP status codes, response payload schema, pagination if applicable
2. Security: JWT/OAuth scope enforcement, field-level encryption for PII, audit log on every write
3. Performance: P95 latency target, max payload size, rate limiting
4. Error handling: 4xx and 5xx scenarios with meaningful error bodies
5. Backward compatibility: versioning strategy, deprecation notice if breaking change
6. Kubernetes: liveness/readiness probe behaviour under load

Format as a numbered AC list plus a test coverage matrix (Unit / Integration / Contract / E2E) in markdown.`
  },
  {
    id:"ac-3", category:"acceptance-criteria",
    title:"SAR Narrative Quality Acceptance Criteria",
    description:"Defines measurable AC for AI-generated or human-authored SAR narratives to meet NCA submission standards.",
